From 8e7906a92e9afb211a018aae61864c8d49382de9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 05:26:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] game-server: login bcrypt nyata, sesi + UDP ber-MAC, phasing
 per map, tes integrasi

- Login/register memverifikasi password (bcryptjs); tamerId dari klien diabaikan
- UDP v2 (44 byte) dengan sessionId + seq anti-replay + HMAC-SHA256
- SessionManager: roster/join/leave per map, persist posisi, stale sweep
- Rate limit WS/UDP, blokir brute-force per IP
- Hapus sisa SQL Server (mssql), schema.sql jadi SQLite, sqlite tidak lagi di-commit
- 13 tes integrasi (node --test), docs/PROTOCOL.md
